# 1️⃣2️⃣ Connected Components

A connected component is:

```text
A group of vertices
connected together.
```

Example:

```text
1 -- 2 -- 3

4 -- 5
```

Components:

```text
{1,2,3}

{4,5}
```

Answer:

```text
2 Components
```

---

## C++ Code

```cpp
int countComponents(
    int n,
    vector<int> adj[])
{
    vector<int> vis(
        n + 1,
        0
    );

    int count = 0;

    for(int i = 1;
        i <= n;
        i++)
    {
        if(!vis[i])
        {
            count++;

            dfs(
                i,
                adj,
                vis
            );
        }
    }

    return count;
}
```

---

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(V + E)

Space: O(V)
```

