# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Adjacency List is preferred in interviews.

✅ BFS uses Queue.

✅ DFS uses Recursion or Stack.

✅ Both BFS and DFS run in O(V+E).

✅ BFS finds shortest path in unweighted graphs.

✅ DFS is heavily used in graph problems.

---

# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Forgetting visited array.

❌ Revisiting nodes repeatedly.

❌ Using adjacency matrix unnecessarily.

❌ Not handling disconnected graphs.

❌ Infinite recursion due to cycles.

